.TH UBUNTUAI-CONFIG 1
.SH NAME
ubuntuai-config \- tune apps installed by ubuntuai-installer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ubuntuai-config
[\fI--explain\fR]
[\fI--show\fR]
[\fI--bind\fR 127.0.0.1|0.0.0.0]
[\fI--model-root\fR path]
[\fI--chat-model\fR name]
[\fI--backend\fR auto|vulkan|rocm|cuda|xdna|cpu]
[\fI--tts\fR id]
[\fI--stt\fR id]
[\fI--openai-uri\fR url]
[\fI--openai-key\fR key]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Companion tuner for workflows the installer applied. Overview lists installed apps and listen address in plain language. Settings pick chat model, speech, and GPU from what is present. Advanced has paths and API fields. Bind defaults to this computer only. \fI--explain\fR prints the same view on the CLI. \fI--show\fR prints config.json.
